<title>SINGAPORE: Pakistan's National Refining plans '97 turnaround.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's National Refining plans '97 turnaround.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's State-owned National Refining Ltd plans to shutdown a 50,000 barrel-per-day crude distillation unit for maintenance for 28 days from the second week of February 1997, a refinery source said on Monday.</p>
<p>NRL has no turnaround plans for a second processing unit at the 75,000-bpd refinery located in Karachi, the source said.</p>
<p>--Singapore Newsroom (+65-870-3086)</p>
</text>
